<Base title="About" description="About Matthias Nordwig, who writes this site.">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p class="lede">I've been writing code since I was eight: C, C++, Delphi. Today I write it mostly
  through AI agents that I direct and check.</p>
  <p>For years I led large teams on large tasks. Among other things, I designed KfW's global compliance
  processes across more than 100 international offices and built much of the workflow software
  behind them myself. That gave me a good understanding of European banking regulation. The long
  version is <a href="/cv/">my CV</a>, plain or as a speedrun.</p>
  <p>The problems I like most are the ones that look too hard at first. Usually one insight makes
  them manageable, and then I use whatever tools there are to get to a result. This site is where I
  write those results down.</p>
  <p class="meta">Personal site. Views and projects here are my own and not published on behalf of
  any employer.</p>
</Base>
